{'symbol': 'URI', 'date': '2023-04-05 16:15:00', 'title': 'UNITED RENTALS TO HOST INVESTOR DAY ON MAY 31, 2023', 'text': "STAMFORD, CONN.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--UNITED RENTALS, INC. (NYSE: URI), THE WORLD'S LARGEST EQUIPMENT RENTAL COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL HOST AN INVESTOR DAY IN NEW YORK CITY ON WEDNESDAY, MAY 31, 2023. MATT FLANNERY, PRESIDENT AND CEO, WILL BE JOINED BY OTHER MEMBERS OF THE EXECUTIVE MANAGEMENT TEAM TO PROVIDE AN IN-DEPTH REVIEW OF UNITED RENTALS' STRATEGY, KEY INITIATIVES, AND FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE."}